    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Summarize the following article in Ukrainian. The summary must be SHORT — a clue whether the article is useful, NOT a full retelling.\n\nUse this EXACT structure:\n\n<b>{{ $json.title }}</b>\n\n<i>Автор:</i> {{ $json.creator || $json['dc:creator'] || 'Невідомо' }}\n<i>Дата:</i> {{ DateTime.fromJSDate(new Date($json.pubDate)).toFormat('dd.MM.yyyy') }}\n<i>Категорія:</i> {{ $json.categories.join(', ') }}\n\nThen write a 2-3 sentence summary in Ukrainian — what the article is about and why it might be useful.\n\nIf there is a key code snippet, include ONE short example wrapped in <pre> tags (max 5 lines). Skip code if not essential.\n\n<a href=\"{{ $json.link }}\">Читати повністю</a>\n\nRules:\n- The header, author, date, category, and link lines above are ALREADY FORMATTED — output them EXACTLY as shown, do NOT change the values\n- Only the 2-3 sentence summary should be generated by you\n- Total length MUST be under 1024 characters\n- Language: Ukrainian (only the summary part)\n- Do NOT use Markdown (no #, *, _, `, ```)\n- Do NOT use <br/>, <ul>, <ol>, <li>, <h1>-<h6>, <p>\n- Telegram HTML mode supports ONLY: <b>, <i>, <u>, <s>, <code>, <pre>, <a>\n- Newlines via actual line breaks, not tags",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        2400,
